WEBVTT

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:20.080
There's a witch with ashen hair
fluttering in the wind

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:23.080
flying in the air on a broom.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.330
Who is this beauty,
as pretty and lovely as a doll,

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:32.200
who makes even the summer sun
want to shine brighter?

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.330
That's right, it's me.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:45.410
These clothes are pretty hot for this season...

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:24.990
The Ripper

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:39.580
It's kind of creepy here...

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:40.410
Hm?

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:43.660
I've gathered you here
today to talk about the crimes.

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:46.080
If you know anything, please tell me.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:48.290
Oh, my Bebe's shoes look
like they're about to fall off.

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:48.290
By crime, does she mean <i>that</i> ?

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:52.540
The people who live in this
country really love dolls, huh?

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:49.910
I'm sure that's what she's talking about.

00:02:49.910 --> 00:02:52.540
It is, huh?

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:59.240
Those of us in the Association
also consider this a serious matter.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:02.790
I'd like your help in
restoring order to this town.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.790
She's from the United Magic Association?

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:05.700
I changed her clothes today. What do you think?

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.120
Oh my, how wonderful.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.740
Did you get that fabric
from that store over there?

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:11.490
I wonder if anything happened...

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:11.490
I did. It was expensive, but I splurged.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:14.040
Lucky. I haven't been able to
get her new clothes for a month.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.660
Well, how about it?

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:18.370
Did you see the Ripper, too?

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:22.370
Huh? The Ripper?

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:27.580
I didn't see the Ripper, but I know
the lives of four women were taken.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.700
Another victim appeared this morning.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:32.040
This time, it was a woman with green hair.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.620
A fifth?

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:35.660
Just this year.

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:38.040
If we include similar incidents
from the past few years,

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:40.290
there have been more than a hundred.

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:45.410
The lives of over a hundred women...
How unsettling.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:46.240
What about you?

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.540
Yes, I saw clearly.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:50.290
Please, tell me more!

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:53.950
It happened seven years ago,
on the night of a full moon.

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:55.990
A man became a werewolf--

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:57.290
Hey, come on.

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:00.080
No, I heard the culprit was a cat woman.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:03.580
No, I heard that the culprit was
a mysterious being, neither male nor female,

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:06.450
from my cousin's friend's
boyfriend's girlfriend.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:07.540
From who?

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:08.910
What are you saying?!

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.200
The culprit is a doll!

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.700
It moves in the night, attacking women--

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:14.330
Oh, how terrifying!

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:17.620
I'm going to go hide out at my parents' house!

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:20.870
Oh my, it sounds pretty bad.

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:27.740
Hey, you. Do you have a minute?

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:29.950
Yes? What is it?

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.450
Are you a citizen of this country?

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:34.830
No, I'm a traveler.

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:40.410
I'm the Night Witch, Sheila.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:45.290
As you can probably tell, I'm a witch
sent by the United Magic Association.

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:49.160
I'm the Ashen Witch, Elaina.

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:56.290
So, do you know about the crimes
that happened in this country?

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.240
About the Ripper?

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:00.620
Yes, I do.

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:03.290
If you're a traveler, then how do you know?

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:07.200
Because you were asking
the townspeople about it earlier.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:11.040
Unfortunately, I don't
know anything else about it.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:15.040
That's too bad.

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:21.370
The people in this town don't know anything.

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:24.240
They just keep saying whatever they want.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.700
If you find out anything, let me know.

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.790
I'll be at that assembly hall,
so come find me there.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:36.870
I don't think I'll find out anything, but okay.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:38.580
Excuse me.

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:45.790
I know dolls are the country's local specialty,

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:48.700
but they really are everywhere, huh?

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.990
"Free dolls"?

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:07.870
They're really amazing.

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:12.790
Welcome to my shop.

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:15.200
The doll--

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:19.540
I made all the dolls in this shop myself!

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:21.990
Your mouth is moving.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.700
If there's one you like,
feel free to take it with you.

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:26.870
Are they really free?

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:28.200
Yup!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:33.830
Why is that? The store is
so rundown--I mean modest.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:35.160
It's fine!

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:36.450
I don't care about money!

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.950
I just want to see everyone's happy faces!

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:44.290
That's why I make lots of dolls and
give them to the townspeople as presents!

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:46.700
Oh? That's noble of you.

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:50.950
If there's one you like,
feel free to take it, Miss Mage!

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:52.410
I'm not a mage--

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:55.660
Don't hold back. Choose one you like.

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:57.410
Look, how about that one?

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.660
It's the most popular one recently.

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:01.870
Um...

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:13.080
I don't have space in my luggage,
but I appreciate the offer.

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:15.490
Well then, excuse me.

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:23.410
Too bad...

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:25.330
To say you don't care about money...

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:29.700
I didn't know there were noble people
with a heart of charity like that...

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:37.160
Right, you'll be in room 5 on the third floor.

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:38.950
Thank you.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:56.870
There's one here, too...

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:07.990
There we go. Now...

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:27.490
This country is just full of dolls.

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:31.580
All the red brick seems like it
might be bad for my eyes, but--

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:56.950
It's hot...

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:01.660
Oh, that feels good...

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:05.490
Huh? When did I open it...?

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:07.490
Oh, well.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:33.870
Now, after I eat breakfast,
shall I go to the next... town...?

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:39.200
Who is this?

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:40.990
Huh?

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:47.740
Did you see the Ripper, too?

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:50.540
...I know the lives of four women were taken.

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:55.450
Hair is... a woman's... life...

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:07.240
As you guessed, this is
definitely the work of the Ripper.

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:09.620
Well, yeah. That's what I thought.

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:14.410
I can't believe even a witch
would fall victim to the Ripper...

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:18.410
Well, anyway, I'll take
a look at the scene of the crime.

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:21.080
What should I do?

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:25.160
Just stay there, out of the way.

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:33.040
Hmm... There's nothing here...

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:42.240
There isn't anything
suspicious under the bed, either.

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:46.950
I think the most suspicious thing
in this room is you, Sheila.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:50.160
I'm not suspicious. I'm conducting a search!

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:53.790
All that's left is that place, huh?

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:02.200
The doll's hair...

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:03.660
Doll?

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:07.410
I put the doll by the bedside into the closet.

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:08.620
I thought so.

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:10.830
Thought what?

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:13.740
All the incidents have had this in common:

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:16.330
The victims were all
attacked while asleep in bed,

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:18.910
the doll inside the room disappeared,

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:22.490
and the doll's hair was scattered in the room.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:23.790
Why?

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:27.580
The victim's hair probably
became the doll's hair.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:28.990
The doll...?

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:32.830
The culprit probably
controls the dolls with magic.

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.700
So, what'll you do?

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:36.830
What'll I do?

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:39.040
Will you go out and investigate in town?

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:41.790
Of course I will.

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:43.450
Let's catch that cowardly culprit,

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:47.370
cut off their head, and send them
to hell to regret what they did!

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:52.080
You're getting too far ahead of yourself.

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:53.790
Is something the matter?

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:56.330
Hm? Um...

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:59.620
I was just thinking that you're pretty thin.

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:06.040
Now, shall we go?

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:08.490
What was your name again?

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:09.990
I told you already.

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:13.160
I'm Elaina. The Ashen Witch.

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:19.450
It's nothing.

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:21.330
Let's go.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:23.410
Have a nice day!

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:27.490
What's wrong?

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:32.200
Don't you think that doll's hair
has a really nice texture?

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:36.990
Yeah, I guess. It's like human hair--

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:44.790
If you don't want to get hurt,
then tell us where you got this doll.

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:45.790
I knew it.

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:47.870
This is human hair, isn't it?

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:48.910
Come on, spit it out!

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:51.240
Th-The secret auction...!

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:52.700
Secret auction?

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:54.040
Y-Yes...

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:59.040
A special auction where
special dolls like Little A are sold.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:01.580
Who are you calling "Little A"?

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:05.450
Where is that secret auction held?!

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:15.240
It's just ahead--

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:17.870
the place where the secret auction is held.

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:21.740
If you hide just your eyes, it's obvious
who's behind the mask, isn't it?

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:24.240
It's getting into the spirit
of things that's important here.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.740
When you put on a mask,

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:28.700
don't you feel like you're doing
something you shouldn't be doing?

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:33.160
Well, the fact that it's a secret auction
should make that obvious already.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.790
Don't say that.

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:48.490
It feels like an opera house.

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:52.790
Apparently, it used to <i>be</i> an opera house.

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:57.040
I'm going to make that doll
Masa' girlfriend today!

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:59.580
I'll definitely win, I'll definitely win,
I'll definitely win, I'll definitely win.

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:02.790
I've been saving up money for the sake of today.

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:04.290
I won't leave until I win.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:06.950
My cutesy-wootsy...

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.160
They're all desperate.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:13.910
I wonder how they can get
so worked up about some dolls.

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:17.200
I don't really get it, but isn't it the desire

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:20.330
to have unorthodox products
that aren't sold in broad daylight?

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:25.080
It's the moment you've all been waiting for!

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:27.870
We've got tons of wonderful
products for you today, too!

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:30.240
If you've got money, you can buy anything!

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:32.790
Everyone, do you want one?

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:35.870
Yeah!

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:40.410
Without further ado, let's get started!

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:43.290
The first product is this!

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.410
So that's what the "unorthodox products" are...

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:58.410
I see!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:14:59.410
Fifty!

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:00.330
A hundred!

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:04.040
One hundred! Anyone else?

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.080
One-fifty!

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:07.240
Three hundred!

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:09.660
Three hundred! Sold!

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:10.870
All right!

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:14.080
I wonder if they're all
going to be dolls like that.

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:16.870
Let's move on. The next one is a gem, too!

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.870
No, I don't think so.

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:20.120
Here's the next product!

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:26.080
It <i>is</i> the same.

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:31.240
The third product is this!

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:36.290
Wanna go back?

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:41.950
Now, everyone, thank you for waiting.

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:45.410
The showcase for today's auction is this!

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:47.870
Oh, is it coming?

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:04.790
That doll with the ash-colored hair--

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:07.870
It looks like the one in
the room I was staying in!

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:10.580
Actually, it <i>is</i> the doll that was in my room.

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:12.740
And that's <i>my</i> hair.

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:17.160
Take a look! To make the hair
on these dolls look more real,

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:20.450
they have real human hair!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:25.160
So it's all hair from the victims.

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:27.950
Calm down, calm down.

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:31.830
They're underestimating me.
They definitely need to die now.

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:35.580
Calm down now. The bidders don't
know how the hair was obtained.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:36.580
They haven't done anything wrong.

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:38.120
On top of that, these are from the Ripper,

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:40.160
the one everyone's been
talking about on the streets!

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:43.370
How about it? Aren't they amazing?!

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:47.290
Damn it, they're making it hard to help them.

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:51.040
Now, the auction starts!

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.040
Wh-What is it?

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.660
Her hair's the same color as the doll's.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:11.700
Could it be...?

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:15.660
You all are enemies of women.

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:18.200
For that crime, you must die.

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:20.790
Ripper, you're here, aren't you?

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:23.330
Please, come out.

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:31.160
You won't come out? I see.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:39.040
And...

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:43.240
Please, stop!

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:45.240
I can't watch!

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:52.870
That's enough.

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:57.160
Will you stop being mean to my doll, please?

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:01.370
So it was you.

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:05.330
Yup, it was me.

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:10.240
When you visited my shop,
I thought, "That hair is lovely!"

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:13.290
Ha, you don't care about money?

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:14.540
In the end,

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:17.080
you were planning to make all your money
here at the secret auction, weren't you?

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:21.240
No, I really don't care about money.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:27.540
I always donate the profits
from the secret auction to the poor.

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:35.080
Then, why are you doing this?

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:37.790
Cutting a woman's hair and making her sad,

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:41.160
even though you said you wanted
to see people's happy faces.

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:43.620
That's because...

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:44.910
Because?

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:48.490
It's true that I want to see happy faces!

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:52.580
My special dolls make the bidders here happy,

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:56.200
and when I donate the money from
the auction, it also makes people happy!

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:58.290
Those faces are the best, aren't they?!

00:18:58.290 --> 00:19:02.160
But just as amazing are the
faces of people when they're sad,

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:06.910
or mad, or laughing--all their different faces!

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:10.040
Expressions of human emotion
are really wonderful, aren't they?

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:12.910
Oh, I can't contain it any longer!

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:19.830
That angry face of yours is good, too...

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:23.620
Uh, right, that's enough. Now, hang on.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:27.200
Oh? Miss Mage, I'm actually a witch.

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:29.580
I'm not someone you can win against.

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:31.830
Oh, I'm a witch, too.

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:33.240
Huh?

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:37.040
Unfortunately, this is the end for you.

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:01.870
Hey. Thanks for your help, Elaina.

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:03.830
You're welcome.

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:06.990
Huh? What will you do? What are you doing?

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:10.040
Aren't you mad? Get more mad!

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:12.870
And then show me your face!

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:16.370
No, show me your face!

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:34.410
And so, the case was closed.

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:39.200
The culprit was taken
by the Night Witch, Sheila,

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:43.290
to a branch of the United Magic Association.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:45.790
She should've gotten the death penalty.

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:54.740
Now, I'll deliver you and get the reward.

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:57.700
Are you happy to get the reward? Are you?

00:20:57.700 --> 00:21:01.080
Show me your happy face more--

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:05.240
Is that you, Teach?

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:11.740
What, you were here?

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:13.950
I just got here.

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:17.490
I needed some money,
so I thought I'd find some work.

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:21.830
What did this person do?

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:24.790
She's looking at me with strangely bright eyes.

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:26.040
Oh, so cute!

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:28.740
I'm sure your mad face is even cuter!

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:32.040
Her? Well...

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:38.200
Actually, she's the Ripper,
who went around cutting women's hair.

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:41.540
She's so evil, she even cut
the hair of a traveling witch.

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:44.660
Oh? The hair of a traveling witch?

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:47.290
She had the same pointy hat and necklace as you,

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:50.910
and she had pretty, ashen hair.

00:21:54.240 --> 00:21:57.830
Ashen hair. Traveling witch.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:03.830
I don't know who you are,
but I can tell that you're mad.

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:09.620
Will you tell me more?

00:22:11.870 --> 00:22:15.950
Oh, that angry face is so good!

00:22:15.950 --> 00:22:18.080
It's the best!
